    {
      "id": "643f282d76a0-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "A large wooden box (open at top) lined with fabric on inner floor and 4 side walls. Inner dimensions: 2.5m x 1.8m x 1.2m. Fabric comes in 50cm square pieces. 15% extra needed for cuts and overlaps. How many fabric pieces should be purchased?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>A large wooden box (open at top) lined with fabric on inner floor and 4 side walls. Inner dimensions: 2.5m x 1.8m x 1.2m. Fabric comes in 50cm square pieces. 15% extra needed for cuts and overlaps. How many fabric pieces should be purchased?</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "59",
          "html": "<p>59</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "62",
          "html": "<p>62</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "69",
          "html": "<p>69</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "72",
          "html": "<p>72</p>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>Total area to be covered = floor + 4 walls<br/>Floor = 2.5 × 1.8 = 4.5 m²<br/>Walls = 2(2.5 × 1.2) + 2(1.8 × 1.2) = 6 + 4.32 = 10.32 m²<br/>Total area = 4.5 + 10.32 = 14.82 m²</p><p>Add 15% extra ⇒ 14.82 × 1.15 = 17.043 m²</p><p>Area of one piece = 0.5 × 0.5 = 0.25 m²</p><p>Number of pieces = 17.043 ÷ 0.25 ≈ 68.17 ≈ 69</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
