    {
      "id": "643f282d76a0-q16",
      "number": 16,
      "question": "If sin A = 0.6, what is the value of tan A?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If sin A = 0.6, what is the value of tan A?</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "0.75",
          "html": "<p>0.75</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0.8",
          "html": "<p>0.8</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1.25",
          "html": "<p>1.25</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "2.56",
          "html": "<p>2.56</p>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>sin A = 0.6 = 3/5</p><p>So, in a right triangle:<br/>Perpendicular = 3, Hypotenuse = 5</p><p>Base = √(5² − 3²)<br/>= √(25 − 9)<br/>= √16<br/>= 4</p><p>Now,<br/>tan A = Perpendicular / Base<br/>= 3/4<br/>= 0.75</p><p>Answer:</p><p>(a) 0.75</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
